# will_memory_targets — the memory panel lists every target of a will
#
# A will's detail box names what it wants under "Wants", one row per target, in the words each target
# is voiced with — as the functions are listed above it. Metalcraft has three. Opened over the world
# map, as here, each row is a button that seeks its target (▸; `will_search_world.cli`).
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --grant-mm metalcraft --location-type test --location-id 0

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
manage Memory
wait
select mm metalcraft
wait
expect Wants
expect ▸ take up ore
expect ▸ take up iron to work
expect ▸ buy iron
quit
